window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Heartbroken and betrayed, I fled the faerie court only to be dragged back by my captor, a dark Fae Prince.</b></p> <p>I should have never made a deal with Ruskin.</p> <p>He's used me before.</p> <p>Now, he needs me again. The Queen has been doomed to eternal sleep. And I alone can break the spell.</p> <p>Once she wakes, my work should be done. I can leave and force myself to forget the handsome prince and his brutal yet beautiful court.</p> <p>Queen Evanthe's return was meant to heal the land, but she's too weak.</p> <p>It doesn't take long to discover that an iron-soaked curse now haunts this land.</p> <p>Only by uncovering the sinister plots woven through the court can I break the curse.</p> <p>I won't be able to do it alone.</p> <p>Somehow, magic runs through my blood, and every day at court I'm closer to unlocking my true power.</p> <p>But it's deeply entwined with the Fae Prince. And he's not to be trusted.</p> <p>Nor can I trust myself around him.</p> <p>His kisses draw me to him, even as his manipulations threaten to tear us apart.</p> <p>And I fear the secrets he's keeping could doom us all.</p>"; 
